@startuml
participant Client
participant "FHIR API" as API
alt No assignment exists
Client->API: POST /Task with completed status
API->API: Validate start and end
API-->Client: 201 Created
else Execution already started
Client->API: PATCH /Task/{executionID}
API->API: Add executionPeriod.end
API-->Client: 200 OK
end
@enduml
